                                <incipit xml:lang="gez"><gap reason="lost"/>ሥጋሁ፡ ይብላዕ፡ ወመረቆ፡ ይስተይ፡ ዝገተኛ፡ ለጋስ፡ ለሰብእ፡ ቍስለ፡ ሥጋ፡ 
                                    <supplied reason="undefined" resp="PRS8999Strelcyn">ሕ</supplied>ፍራህ፡ ሠናይ፡ <unclear>ወርኁ፡</unclear> ወሬዛ፤ 
                                    ያቈሰሎ፡ አባሉ፡ ጫንቃሁ፡ ወአብራኪሁ፡ ወአፃብዒሁ፡ ወአዕጋሪሁ፡ የሐምም፡ ዘማዊ፤</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="p2_i2">
                                <locus from="2v" to="5r"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7594HassabSick">Ḥassāba dǝwwǝy (general record)</title>
                                <note>Calculation concerning a man who is ill, giving seven possibilities</note>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ሐሳበ፡ ድውይ፡ ስም፡ ወእም፡ በ፯ግድፍ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="p2_i3">
                                <locus from="5r" to="5v"/><locus target="#17r"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7570HassabHara">Ḥassāba ḥarā (general record)</title>
                                <note>Calculation concerning a soldier, giving nine possibilities. This text occupies the lower part of 
                                    <locus target="#5v"/> and the upper part of <locus target="#17r"/>. The two folia 5 and 17 form one bifolium and 
                                    were separated by fols 6-16 when the manuscript was bound.</note>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ሐሳበ፡ ሐራ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="p2_i4">
                                <locus from="6r" to="16v"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7644ZodiacBE">1 ḥamal fǝkkārehu</title>
                                <note>The eulogistic formula seems to show that the owner belonged to the Beta ʾƎsrāʾel.</note>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">ይትባረክ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ አምላከ፡ እስራኤል፡ ፩ ሐመል፡ ፍካሬሁ። እሳት፡ ዘበዳ፡ ውእቱ፡ ኮከብ፡ በዓረቢ፡ ናፌል፡ ይትበሀል፡ አእማሪ፡
                                    ኅሩር፡ ወምስለ፡ ፫ ከዋክብት፡ ይሠርቅ፤ ክፍሉ፡ ሚዛን፡ ገጹ፡ ግሩም፡ ወዕሙቅ፡ ምክሩ፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="p2_i5">
                                <locus from="17r" to="17v"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7611HassAdbar">Ḥassāba ʾadbār (general record)</title>
                                <note>Calculation of mountains with four possibilities. Written in a very poor hand (<ref target="#h3"/>) in violet ink.</note>
                            </msItem>
                            <msItem xml:id="p2_i6">
                                <locus from="17v" to="20v"/>
                                <title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT7611HassAdbar">Ḥassāba ʾadbār (general record)</title>
                                <note>Calculation concerning mountains with eight possibilities. Written in the same very poor hand as the previous item
                                    (<ref target="#h3"/>). The title was written in violet and the text in black ink.</note>
                            </msItem>
